    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n            <p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">Hello everyone,<br>\r\nI hope this email finds you well.</font></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">I have just started using this package to analyze Actigraphy data from the Parquet format. Since this data format is not supported by the package, I first converted it into CSV using R.<br>\r\nThe dataset is structured with timestamp, acc_x, acc_y, and acc_z, which I believe are suitable for GGIR.</font></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">Given that my timestamps are in POSIX format, they include the &quot;Z&quot; (indicating the local time zone) after the time value. I mention this because, while reading the guide, I noticed that the example does not include the &quot;Z&quot; (<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html-Part3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html-Part3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488719740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35iNn80JhoX_EzJ6GWVD-h\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/readmyacccsv.html-Part3</a>)</span>.</font></p><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">my file: </font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">&quot;TimeStamp,Accel_ax1,Accel_ax2,Accel_ax3</font></div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">2023-03-31T17:09:18.000004Z,-0.65625,-0.125,0.703125&quot; </font><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">My code:</font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Arial\">GGIR(<br>  mode=c(1,2),<br>  datadir = &quot;/Users/martinacarnevale/Desktop/TEST/input&quot;,<br>  outputdir = &quot;/Users/martinacarnevale/Desktop/TEST/output&quot;,<br>  data_format = &quot;actigraph_csv&quot;, <br>  read.myacc.csv(rmc.file=c(&quot;/Users/martinacarnevale/Desktop/try.csv&quot;), rmc.nrow=Inf, rmc.dec=&quot;.&quot;,<br>                 rmc.firstrow.acc = c(2), rmc.firstrow.header=c(1),<br>                 rmc.header.length = c(1),<br>                 rmc.col.acc=c(2,3,4),<br>                 rmc.unit.time = &quot;POSIX&quot;,<br>                 rmc.format.time=&quot;%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%OS&quot;,<br>                 rmc.unit.acc = &quot;g&quot;,<br>                  desiredtz = &quot;Europe/Berlin&quot;,<br>                  configtz = &quot;Europe/Berlin&quot;))</font><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\" size=\"3\">Error: No milestone data found for part(s) 1. Run this/these first before running part 2.<br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\" size=\"3\">and &quot;object &#39;rawData&#39; not found&quot; (if I run only the part 1)</font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">I also tryed using Actigraph datas from testifies <a href=\"https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/inst/testfiles/ActiGraph13.csv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/inst/testfiles/ActiGraph13.csv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488719740000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JWOFDwG9BRoVkHCxIPjqK\">https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/blob/master/inst/testfiles/ActiGraph13.csv</a> but it didn&#39;t work. </font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">Thank you in advance.</font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">Best wishes,</font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">Martina Carnevale</font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><br></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div><font style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/fLHijx6bXq8QzaTukKuLR4c0h_sv-ySBVA6o8X67K3RjD_EuZGG2EocEt-Ifowpwfc6ffD8O9P-pfAgwV3_VHXUEwA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://www.unibs.it/it/footer-email-unibs-final\"><br></font></div><div><font style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><font style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\" face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">Informativa sulla Privacy: </font><a style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\" href=\"https://www.unibs.it/it/node/1452\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=e